      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Hume Auctioneers ? We Get The Pick Of The Crop\n\nHume Auctioneers are delighted to present this magnificent three-bedroom semi-detached family home to the market. Finished to an exceptional standard throughout and boasting one of the finest landscaped rear gardens of its type; to be found anywhere in the area, this stunning residence offers luxurious turnkey living in a mature and highly sought-after development.\n\nFrom the moment you arrive, the home's striking façade, generous driveway and manicured front lawn create an immediate impression of quality. Step through the front door and you are welcomed by a bright, spacious entrance hall with quality timber flooring, bespoke radiator covers and elegant décor, setting the tone for the immaculate accommodation that lies beyond.\n\nThe beautifully proportioned sitting room is an inviting space, centred around an elegant feature fireplace with solid fuel stove, creating the perfect setting for cosy evenings. Across the hall, a guest WC completes the ground floor accommodation.\n\nTo the rear, the superb open-plan kitchen and dining room is undoubtedly the heart of the home. Stylish contemporary cabinetry, extensive worktop space and a wonderful dining area combine to create a space perfectly suited to modern family life. French doors open directly onto the magnificent patio, seamlessly blending indoor and outdoor living. A large fully fitted utility room provides excellent additional storage together with independent rear access.\n\nUpstairs, the sense of space continues with a bright and airy landing leading to three beautifully appointed double bedrooms. The principal bedroom is exceptionally spacious and enjoys a luxurious ensuite bathroom, while the remaining bedrooms are equally impressive and are serviced by a pristine family bathroom. Every room has been presented with exceptional care and taste, allowing the next owners to simply move in and enjoy.\n\nOutside, this home truly comes into its own. The spectacular landscaped rear garden has been thoughtfully designed as a private outdoor sanctuary. Extensive patios, raised flower beds, and carefully planned entertaining areas create an outstanding space for family life and entertaining alike. \n\nEvery element of this outstanding property reflects pride of ownership. Beautifully maintained, tastefully decorated and presented in genuine showhouse condition throughout, this is a home that will appeal to the most discerning purchasers.\n\nHomes of this calibre rarely become available.\nThe property is in mint condition throughout, spotlessly clean and comes to the market in move in condition.\n\n1gb broadband\n\nWalking distance to excellent primary and secondary schools, shops and all amenities.\n"
